  description: "Acil \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015F yollar\u0131n\u0131n e\u015Fya ve kolilerle
    kapat\u0131lmas\u0131, olas\u0131 bir acil durumda \xE7al\u0131\u015Fanlar\u0131n
    h\u0131zl\u0131 ve g\xFCvenli \u015Fekilde tahliye edilmesini engelleyerek ciddi
    yaralanma ve panik riskine yol a\xE7ar. Ka\xE7\u0131\u015F yollar\u0131n\u0131n
    her zaman tam a\xE7\u0131k, d\xFCzenli ve eri\u015Filebilir olmas\u0131 acil
    durum y\xF6netiminin en temel g\xFCvenlik \u015Fart\u0131d\u0131r.\r\n"
